##Mudar ícones programaticamente##

<div class="example litle">
<a target=icone href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/GNOME_Desktop_icons#Status">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/GNOME_Desktop_icons#Status</a></div>

